    <p>Start by reviewing the alerts and new High risk score tied to a.rodriguez, given its privileged, high-impact, multi-flagged status.</p>
  </section>
  <section class=\\"section\\">
    <h2>Entities to investigate first</h2>
    
    <ol class=\\"priorities\\">
      <li class=\\"priority\\">
        <span class=\\"rank\\">1</span>
        <div class=\\"head\\">
          <div class=\\"name\\">a.rodriguez</div>
          <div class=\\"badges\\">
            <span class=\\"badge hollow\\">User</span>
            <span class=\\"badge risk\\"><svg viewBox=\\"0 0 16 16\\" width=\\"12\\" height=\\"12\\" role=\\"img\\" aria-label=\\"resolution group\\"><path fill=\\"currentColor\\" fill-rule=\\"evenodd\\" clip-rule=\\"evenodd\\" d=\\"M11.984 9.63a2 2 0 1 1-.707.707L8.5 7.56v3.857a2 2 0 1 1-1 0V7.56l-2.777 2.777a2 2 0 1 1-.707-.707L7.5 6.147V2.56L5.353 4.707 4.646 4 8 .646 11.353 4l-.707.707L8.5 2.56v3.586l3.484 3.485Zm1.016.724a1 1 0 1 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 0 0-2Zm-6 3a1 1 0 1 1 2 0 1 1 0 0 1-2 0Zm-5-2a1 1 0 1 1 2 0 1 1 0 0 1-2 0Z\\"/></svg>Risk: High, 76</span>
            <span class=\\"badge hollow\\"><span class=\\"dot\\" data-level=\\"high_impact\\"></span>High impact</span>
          </div>
